<title>UK: IKB sets 500 million FRN due April 2001.</title>
<headline>IKB sets 500 million FRN due April 2001.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-01-22</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following floating-rate issue</p>
<p>was announced by joint lead managers BHF-Bank and IKB.</p>
<p> BORROWER   IKB DEUTSCHE INDUSTRIEBANK AG</p>
<p> AMT    500 MLN DEM   BASE     **2M-LIBOR  MATURITY    25.APR.01</p>
<p> TYPE	 FRN	 MARGIN     FLAT	PAY DATE    25.FEB.97</p>
<p> MOODY/S&amp;P  =	   ISS PRICE  100.08    FULL FEES   20 BP</p>
<p> NOTES	**FOR FIRST TWO MONTHS, THEN 3M LIBOR FLAT</p>
<p> LISTING    DUES	DENOMS (K) 1	   SALE LIMITS =</p>
<p> NEG PLG    NO	  CRS DEFLT  NO	  FORCE MAJ   YES</p>
<p> GOV LAW    GERMAN    HOME CTRY  GERMANY   TAX PROVS   =</p>
<p> MGT/UND    10 BP     SELL CONC  10 BP     PRAECIPUUM  =</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 8863</p>
</text>
